flowchart LR
    S[Save current<br/>version SHA]:::stage --> D[Deploy new<br/>version]:::stage
    D --> H{Health<br/>check}:::gate
    H -->|pass| OK[Deploy done]:::ok
    H -->|fail| R[Roll back to<br/>previous SHA]:::rollback
    R --> F[Mark workflow<br/>failed]:::fail

    classDef stage fill:#D5E8F4,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef gate fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef ok fill:#BFDBED,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:3px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef rollback fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef fail fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
